Package: rLabelDocs
Title: Interactive Document Classification and Labeling System
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Matthias", "Uckert", , "Matthias.Uckert@Outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "YOUR-ORCID-ID"))
Description: A comprehensive Shiny-based application for document classification and 
    labeling workflows. Provides an interactive interface for classifying documents 
    according to predefined schemas, tracking classification progress, and managing 
    multi-user annotation projects. Features include document browsing with filtering, 
    real-time progress analytics, user activity tracking, and export capabilities. 
    Designed for research teams, legal document review, content analysis, and any 
    scenario requiring systematic document categorization with quality control and 
    progress monitoring.
